==Battleground==
*10 [[Croco]]s (100%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Croco]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Moe Uzumasa & Doge]] spawns.
**1 [[Saki Matsuga & Doge]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s (100%) spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

